              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ndyabashemeza, mbaiheho orubanja rwona orw'ebibi ebi bancumwireho; kandi ndyabasaasira eby'okushiisha byabo byona, ebi bancumwireho n'ebi baakozire nibangomera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.8"
            ]
