              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " nigwo gurigaruka kuhurirwamu eiraka ry'okushemererwa n'okwesiima, eiraka rya kishwera na kishwerwa, n'amaraka g'abarikweshongora, nibareeta omu nju ya MUKAMA empongano z'okusiima nibagira bati:",
