          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyaija ahari Yeremia nikigira kiti: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Torikuteekateeka aha ki abo bantu barikugamba nibagira bati: MUKAMA ayangire enganda ezo ibiri ezi yaatooraine? Okwo nikwo bagayire abantu bangye, ngu tibakiri ihanga omu maisho gaabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Kuri ntarahamize ndagaano yangye ei naaragaine na nyomushana na nyekiro, kandi ntarahamize biragiro by'eiguru n'ensi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obwo nibwo naakwangire oruzaaro rwa Yakobo n'orwa Daudi omwiru wangye, nkanga kutoorana omwe aha baijukuru be kutegyeka oruzaaro rwa Abrahamu, Isaaka na Yakobo. Ahabw'okuba ndyabagarura, mbaihe omu bukwatwa, mbagirire embabazi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.26"
            ]
          }
        }
